title: $:/mf/gen/GUI command/cursor:next
catalog: GUI command
target: cursor:next
summary: Move a panel's cursor down one row (self / a panel type)

!! Reference

* Defined by the shell (a builtin)

!! Default keys

* ``down`` → ``cursor:next self``
* ``down`` → ``cursor:next metarecord-list`` (while ``finder`` is focused)
* ``down`` → ``cursor:next metarecord-list`` (in the ``file`` panel)
* ``j`` → ``cursor:next self``
